id: pm-slack-standup-github-efbbd7c92737-113
title: Preserve Unicode code points when clipping Block Kit standup sections
description: "GH issue #113: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-slack-standup/issues/113 · author @unbraind · state reason completed · created 2026-10-12T08:44:49Z · updated 2026-10-13T12:28:22Z"
